{"id":"vod_lz_22602","vodId":"22602","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"向山进发","name_cn":"向山进发","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220611-1/13ddee763a276f179ebcd7ebdf724e34.jpg"},"summary":"刚刚升入高中的雪村葵（井口裕香 配音）是一个性格内向到有些古怪的女孩子，她不擅长与人交际，更乐于独自一人宅在家中尝试各种有趣事物，即使被同学疏远也全不介意。童年的她曾经热衷爬山，但在一次攀登公园器材时摔成了骨折，从此罹患恐高症。开学第一天，小葵便与小学时代的朋友日向（阿澄佳奈 配音）重逢。当年两个小家伙曾共同爬上山顶，见识了壮美的自然风光，更相约日后再攀高峰。小葵早已忘掉当初的誓言，但乐观开朗的日向却记着彼此的约定。看来小葵真到了走出家门，回归大自然怀抱的时候了……                                     　　本片根据日本插画家Shiro（しろ）的同名原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-06-11 19:52:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24035_b004741a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24036_db64ecb3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24037_50af54b1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24040_eeb925ca/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24039_c7d55b92/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24038_79eab97e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24041_12e307cf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24042_5c552211/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24044_bed1845a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24043_7f40e53e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24045_7b9240fd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24047_88b3ff25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220611/24046_8fbc2fbe/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:37.600Z"}